invariant: INV-16
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: hash_runtime_test
reason: the configuration hash runs every update on sha256.c whatever the
  session's ch_cfg.cpu states, so a session that states the SHA-256
  instructions hashes its anchors on the portable code
  (docs/decisions.md 132). bin/hash_runtime_test's
  webpki_ticket_config_hash row counts those updates on the wrong path.

--- old
#ifdef CH_CPU_RUNTIME
    sha256_update_cpu(cpu, s, in, n);
#else
--- new
#ifdef CH_CPU_RUNTIME
    (void)cpu;
    sha256_update(s, in, n);
#else
